{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜審計署發表審計報告／中華總商會會董就職典禮\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261125.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】審計署署長今日(11月25日)發表第87號報告書衡工量值式審計結果。另外，香港中華總商會舉行會董就職典禮，行政長官李家超、中聯辦主任周霽、外交部駐港特派員崔建春出席。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:04:21.943443+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:52.182013+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:57:49.873148+00:00","content_hash":"fce4835138b7584a5d1894a3960242ca93394dd1be7930d42f93d79d3d6fdbdd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}